        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo ST-386 Mortise 86 Cut Out to ANSI Strike Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis conversion plate allows for switching from an 86 cut out (standard mortise lock) to a ANSI strike plate. Used with  <a href=\"/products/ansi-stainless-steel-strike-plate-don-jo-st-161-630\"><b>ANSI Stainless Steel Strike Plate</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/ansi-stainless-steel-deadbolt-strike-plate-don-jo-bfd-2-630\"><b>ANSI Deadbolt Strike Plate</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-mortise-strike-plate-don-jo-mst-161-630\"><b>ANSI Mortise Strike Plate</b></a> or any other 4-7/8\" tall ANSI strike plate.  Plate is reversible. Packaged with 2 installation screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-MDT-finish.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"590\" height=\"350\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo ST-386 Conversion Strike Plate Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Don-Jo ST-386 Deadbolt Strike Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Length: 8\" (8.00)</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 1-1/4\" (1.250)</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Primer</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: 2 each #12-24 x 1/2\" Flat Head Machine Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ST-386.pdf?v=1704262440\"><b>Don-Jo ST-386 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
